# The identity relation on {1, 2} defines an image set by replacement.
prop identity_relation(x, y set):
    y = x
forall x {1, 2}, y, z set:
    $identity_relation(x, y)
    $identity_relation(x, z)
    =>:
        y = z
have by replacement_axiom: Image from prop identity_relation, set {1, 2}
$is_set(Image)
$identity_relation(1, 1)
1 $in Image
exist x {1, 2} st {$identity_relation(x, 1)}
